      "category": "etymology",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 2,
      "text": "In 1974, Littleton voted to become solely part of Halifax County, ending its split between Warren and Halifax.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        3
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Littleton%2C_North_Carolina",
      "category": "history",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 3,
      "text": "Alban’s Episcopal Church and the Charles and Susan Skinner House are both listed on the National Register of Historic Places.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        4,
