      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Littleton%2C_North_Carolina",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 4,
      "text": "Littleton hosts the Cryptozoology & Paranormal Museum, also known as the Bigfoot Museum.",
      "sourceSentenceIds": [
        21
      ],
      "sourceLabels": [
        "Wikipedia"
      ],
      "source": "https://en.wikipedia.org/wiki/Littleton%2C_North_Carolina",
      "category": "landmark",
      "quality": "good"
    },
    {
      "id": 5,
      "text": "Littleton sits midway between I‑85 and I‑95, just below the Virginia border, nestled between Halifax and Warren counties.",
